{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/914d9aedab4ed1584eb49a86d2911835.poster.avif?t=1771943265\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/914d9aedab4ed1584eb49a86d2911835.webm?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/914d9aedab4ed1584eb49a86d2911835.mp4?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Lootbound: Take risks and assemble your party and build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run starts solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move along the map, choose your own adventure, and weigh the risks and rewards. You\u2019ll meet companions along the way. Together with them, you create your own playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect build might come together in seamless synchronicity \u2014 or it could go the other way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/9bac39730e1d7d1bff75f7f694aa0e4a.poster.avif?t=1771943265\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/9bac39730e1d7d1bff75f7f694aa0e4a.webm?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/9bac39730e1d7d1bff75f7f694aa0e4a.mp4?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Party and equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions follow the same rules as the hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items only work when equipped. Your choice of equipment directly impacts the party\u2019s behavior and how the build works as a whole. One item could make a character the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another could turn them into dead weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/9d68fff891a0a8f9dbcc2fc02cc74a9f.poster.avif?t=1771943265\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/9d68fff891a0a8f9dbcc2fc02cc74a9f.webm?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/9d68fff891a0a8f9dbcc2fc02cc74a9f.mp4?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item auras</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items exist on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But they really shine when they start to influence each other. Some items have auras and strengthen adjacent items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good combination can change the course of the entire run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7129577d814cc6ef2c6c9551ee99aff4.poster.avif?t=1771943265\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7129577d814cc6ef2c6c9551ee99aff4.webm?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7129577d814cc6ef2c6c9551ee99aff4.mp4?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills and progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hero starts with a base set of skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything they get after that is exclusively up to you. You\u2019re not just increasing numbers. You\u2019re creating the character\u2019s combat style on the go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And your choices? They\u2019re final.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/220044155e0f1991ed2ed24aa5d2c210.poster.avif?t=1771943265\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/220044155e0f1991ed2ed24aa5d2c210.webm?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/220044155e0f1991ed2ed24aa5d2c210.mp4?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Damage types</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various kinds of damage in Lootbound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each kind interacts differently with armor and enemy health, allowing you to create a build around the mechanics of your choice: armor penetration, exhaustion, armor destruction, or direct damage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lootbound is...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tactical roguelike with high replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your party is assembled as you progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment with auras and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builds that are created around damage types and item interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calculated risk and reward selection through dice rolls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run brings a new party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every build is a direct result of your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake will stay with you till the end. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3091140?t=1771943265","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/c310f0bdb395f48da23d0222b8cfaca56c2cd869/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771943265","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/0d5dda4ce75a10d4c90eecf2cf5af90274bb108a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771943265","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/0d5dda4ce75a10d4c90eecf2cf5af90274bb108a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771943265","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4290960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/914d9aedab4ed1584eb49a86d2911835.poster.avif?t=1771943265\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/914d9aedab4ed1584eb49a86d2911835.webm?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/914d9aedab4ed1584eb49a86d2911835.mp4?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Lootbound: Take risks and assemble your party and build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run starts solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move along the map, choose your own adventure, and weigh the risks and rewards. You\u2019ll meet companions along the way. Together with them, you create your own playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect build might come together in seamless synchronicity \u2014 or it could go the other way.</p><p class=\