ood combination can change the course of the entire run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7129577d814cc6ef2c6c9551ee99aff4.poster.avif?t=1771943265\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7129577d814cc6ef2c6c9551ee99aff4.webm?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7129577d814cc6ef2c6c9551ee99aff4.mp4?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills and progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hero starts with a base set of skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything they get after that is exclusively up to you. You\u2019re not just increasing numbers. You\u2019re creating the character\u2019s combat style on the go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And your choices? They\u2019re final.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/220044155e0f1991ed2ed24aa5d2c210.poster.avif?t=1771943265\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/220044155e0f1991ed2ed24aa5d2c210.webm?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/220044155e0f1991ed2ed24aa5d2c210.mp4?t=1771943265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Damage types</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various kinds of damage in Lootbound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each kind interacts differently with armor and enemy health, allowing you to create a build around the mechanics of your choice: armor penetration, exhaustion, armor destruction, or direct damage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lootbound is...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tactical roguelike with high replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your party is assembled as you progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment with auras and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builds that are created around damage types and item interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calculated risk and reward selection through dice rolls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run brings a new party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every build is a direct result of your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake will stay with you till the end. </p></li></ul>","developers":["ArtDock"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/ee5a1b7d01906b38a9db936013ce71a93ef22ee6/header.jpg?t=1771943265","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3091140/542951224/f6a3372846feed7c64e8570ffefc6679970b430f/1771515144/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771515520","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3091140/542951224/f6a3372846feed7c64e8570ffefc6679970b430f/1771515144/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771515520","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3091140/542951224/f6a3372846feed7c64e8570ffefc6679970b430f/1771515144/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771515520","id":257290189,"name":"SNF","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257290189/491c414ebf84cb4fd98023665192072803a7216b/mo